Original packaging and launcher freeze six project source modules without
modification: release_sbom.py, source_delivery.py, recipe_source_delivery.py,
recipe_source_delivery_v2.py, archive_stream.py and package_checks.py.
Their original headers are retained. package_checks.py is original project
source covered by the repository's top-level MIT LICENSE. Byte hashes, original
paths and observed revisions are recorded in source-provenance.json.

Build-only topmem fixture sources retain their original MIT notices. Synthetic
release/package fixtures are inert test data and grant no source-completeness,
license, native execution, hardware, signing or release acceptance.
No official CachyOS or Asahi affiliation or approval is implied.
